<title>UK: Cariplo adds 200 bln lira to 15-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Cariplo adds 200 bln lira to 15-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased by 200 billion lira to 1.0 trillion lira, joint lead</p>
<p>managers Cariplo and J P Morgan said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CASSA DI RISPARMIO DELLE PROVINCIE LOMBARDE</p>
<p> AMT    *1.0 TRL ITL  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY  **04.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  31.755    PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-50-100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FUNGIBLE ON 15.JAN.97 WITH OUTSTANDING 800 BLN LIRA</p>
<p>		 ISSUE</p>
<p>	     **CALL ON 04.NOV.03 AT 49.635</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
